# Settings (the native host, the default since task 014 P3e), opened from its tile: full screen on the native display.
# Root menu, then the Screen and System sections. These are the Settings goldens (640x480 and 480x320; the other
# sizes are review only); the first baseline of the native Settings, re-shot on 2026-10-11 from the compat ones.
title settings
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
bt on
home
launch Settings
wait 300
shot settings_root
key ENTER
wait 300
shot settings_screen
key ESC
wait 300
key UP
wait 300
shot settings_root_system
key ENTER
wait 300
shot settings_system
